Story       EMA Trend + RVI Buy
Trading     BTC/USD 4H chart
Sources     21 EMA, 55 EMA, ADX, RVI, bull flag chart pattern


  Given     price regime on 4H and 1D charts are both ranging,
            as calculated by: ADX(14) below 20
  When      the 21EMA crosses above the 55EMA
  And       RVI drops below 30
  And       price retraces towards the 55 EMA,
            forming a downward-sloping consolidation channel (a Bull Flag)
  Then      Go Long
  With      500 USD of position
  SL        3%
  Until     price has risen:
            5% (TP1)
            10% (TP2)
  Taking    20% at TP1, then 20% at TP2, then trailing stop following 1% behind
  Unless    RVI downward for more than 2 bars

Notes:
  RVI is Relative Volatility Index
